WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:07.800
- A huge part of CIFAR

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.600
is to not only meet,

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.490
but regularly talk with,

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:12.870
share ideas with

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.185
the true luminaries of my field.

00:00:15.185 --> 00:00:16.420
Hi, I'm Yang-Yang Zhou.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.860
I'm a political scientist

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:20.550
and I'm a CIFAR Azrieli Global Scholar.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.110
CIFAR has really allowed me

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:25.500
to expand my global
network in several ways.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.780
I get to belong to a research program

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:28.951
where I have direct access

00:00:28.951 --> 00:00:31.470
to top senior scholars.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.640
Another way that CIFAR
has expanded my networks

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.750
is through the other global scholars.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.940
Many of them are in the natural sciences

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.109
and for these people,

00:00:40.109 --> 00:00:42.240
I would never really get to meet them

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.770
naturally on my own.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.480
So it's been an amazing opportunity

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:46.500
through CIFAR to get

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.970
to talk to them regularly.

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:51.360
One huge benefit of being
a CIFAR Global Scholar

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.360
is getting this unrestricted
research funding.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.010
What that means for me is that

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.980
I can pursue much more ambitious projects.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.118
It actually helps me

00:01:00.118 --> 00:01:03.720
to apply for larger grants later on.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.100
So it allows me to prove

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.750
to other funding agencies

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.580
that I can take on these large projects

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:10.830
because I already have done it.

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.390
Through all of the resources

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:13.740
that CIFAR provides,

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:14.918
the unrestricted funding,

00:01:14.918 --> 00:01:18.570
access to the senior scholars of my field

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:19.740
and related fields,

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.729
getting to meet all these other peers

00:01:21.729 --> 00:01:23.280
in our global scholars,

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.450
having professional development workshops,

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:27.480
all of those resources put together

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:28.906
has just really amplified

00:01:28.906 --> 00:01:32.373
our initial potential into
something much greater.

